{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://img.tvb.com/inews_admin/pro/20260527/entry_horizontal_6a1773e9ae58c95313869874_1779922563055_640x360.jpg\"/><p>英皇資本截至三月底止中期按年少賺三成，純利接近3,900萬元，期內減值撥備減少近三成九，超過3,200萬元。</p><p>收入跌六成二，至1.47億元。不派中期息。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-27T23:18:48.803599+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":76,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}